---
const x = (g: number) => 36 + (g / 3) * 180;
const y = (s: number) => 212 - (s / 0.4) * 160;
const curve = (factor: number) =>
  Array.from({ length: 151 }, (_, i) => {
    const g = i / 50;
    return `${i === 0 ? 'M' : 'L'}${x(g)},${y(g * Math.exp(-factor * g))}`;
  }).join(' ');
---

<figure>
  <p>S: entregas por tempo de trama.</p>
  <p>Com ranhuras: traço contínuo. Puro: tracejado.</p>
  <div class="chart">
    <svg
      viewBox="0 0 240 292"
      role="img"
      aria-labelledby="rc-aloha-title rc-aloha-desc"
    >
      <title id="rc-aloha-title">Tentativas e entregas em ALOHA</title>
      <desc id="rc-aloha-desc">
        O débito puro atinge 0,184 em G=0,5; com ranhuras atinge 0,368 em G=1.
        Ambas as curvas descem depois do máximo, apesar de aumentarem as
        tentativas.
      </desc>
      {[0, 0.1, 0.2, 0.3, 0.4].map((s) => (
        <g>
          <line class="grid" x1="36" y1={y(s)} x2="216" y2={y(s)} />
          <text x="28" y={y(s) + 5} text-anchor="end">
            {s.toLocaleString('pt-PT')}
          </text>
        </g>
      ))}
      <line class="grid" x1="36" y1="52" x2="36" y2="212" />
      <path class="slotted" d={curve(1)} />
      <path class="pure" d={curve(2)} />
      <circle cx={x(1)} cy={y(1 / Math.E)} r="4" />
      <circle cx={x(0.5)} cy={y(1 / (2 * Math.E))} r="4" />
      {[0, 0.5, 1, 2, 3].map((g) => (
        <text x={x(g)} y="235" text-anchor="middle">
          {g.toLocaleString('pt-PT')}
        </text>
      ))}
      <text x="126" y="263" text-anchor="middle">
        <tspan x="126" dy="0">
          G: tentativas por
        </tspan>
        <tspan x="126" dy="16">
          tempo de trama
        </tspan>
      </text>
    </svg>
  </div>
  <figcaption>
    Aumentar G de 0,5 para 1 já reduz as entregas no ALOHA puro. As ranhuras
    deslocam o máximo, mas não eliminam a descida sob muitas tentativas.
  </figcaption>
</figure>
<style>
  .chart {
    max-width: 100%;
  }
  .chart svg {
    max-width: 320px;
    margin-inline: auto;
  }
  figure {
    margin: 24px 0;
  }
  svg {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    height: auto;
  }
  text {
    fill: var(--text);
    font:
      16px 'Manrope Variable',
      sans-serif;
  }
  .grid {
    stroke: var(--line);
  }
  path {
    fill: none;
    stroke-width: 2.5;
  }
  .slotted {
    stroke: var(--accent);
  }
  .pure {
    stroke: var(--text);
    stroke-dasharray: 6 4;
  }
  circle {
    fill: var(--text);
  }
  figcaption {
    margin-top: 8px;
    color: var(--muted);
    font-size: 0.9em;
  }
</style>
